IMAPAccount posteo
Host posteo.de
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
User {{ .email | quote }}
PassCmd {{ if eq .chezmoi.os "darwin" }}"security find-generic-password -s mail-sync -w 2>/dev/null || gpg -dq --no-tty ~/.dotfiles/secrets/smtp-pass.gpg"{{ else }}"gpg -dq --no-tty ~/.dotfiles/secrets/smtp-pass.gpg"{{ end }}
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/cert.pem

IMAPStore posteo-remote
Account posteo

MaildirStore posteo-local
Path ~/.local/share/mail/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel posteo
Far :posteo-remote:
Near :posteo-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
